      textKey: narrative.route_reopened.debrief.01
      englishFallback: The hub is ours, both lifelines stayed open, and the road
        crew restored the broken lane under fire. Samira's teams are already returning
        the captured equipment to civilian service.
      speaker: 1
      voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 8065c5b7fdb0847b395c1ebb97b90201, type: 3}
