    - lineId: route_reopened-debrief-02
      textKey: narrative.route_reopened.debrief.02
      englishFallback: Protocol Fragment Two assembled. Every diverted road, Fuel
        load, market transfer and power handshake fed selected dormant Civic Relay
        nodes. The attacks were preparation, not random destruction.
      speaker: 3
      voiceClip: {fileID: 8300000, guid: 33f4abff4123145bfa9141d690ed0d18, type: 3}
